\pard\li284\sl360\slmult1 2.2. File format\par

\pard\li568\sl240\slmult1 A gzip consists of a series of  "members" (compressed data sets). The format of each member is specified in the following section. The members simplu appear one after another in the file, with no additional inforamation before, between, or after them.\par
\par

\pard\li284\sl360\slmult1 2.3. Member format\par

\pard\li568\sl240\slmult1 Each member has the following structure :\par
\trowd\trgaph72\trleft852\trpaddl72\trpaddr72\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx1392\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx1847\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx2257\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx2847\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx3632\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx4102\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx4572 
\pard\intbl\f1 ID1\cell ID2\cell CM\cell FLG\cell MTIME\cell XFL\cell OS\cell\row 
\pard\li568\sl240\slmult1\f0 (if FLG.FEXTRA set)\par
\trowd\trgaph72\trleft852\trpaddl72\trpaddr72\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx1452\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx6137 
\pard\intbl\f1 XLEN\cell ...XLEN bytes of "extra field"... (more-->)\cell\row 
\pard\li568\sl240\slmult1\f0 (if FLG.FNAME set)\par
\trowd\trgaph72\trleft852\trpaddl72\trpaddr72\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\clbrdrl\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrt\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrw1\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrw1\brdrs \cellx6417 
